  "title": "Party in the Front, Shower in the Back",
  "date": "2023-06-08",
  "excerpt": "El Capitan Build Tier",
  "body": [
    "This build is one of our most unique layouts. The design flips the script, taking what you know and spinning it 180 degrees. We've got the party upfront (that's where you'll find the bed and seating area) and the shower in the back.",
    "Get ready to rest like royalty on a king-size bed. And here's the best part, it's on an automatic Happijac lift! Underneath, there's a full seating area and a large lagun table that's just begging for good times with friends.",
    "But it doesn't stop there. This van is dressed to impress with a custom roof rack, an automatic awning, a 300W solar system, and 300 Ah lithium ion batteries to help power the Dometic RTX 2000 AC unit. We've flipped the usual layout and loaded it with amazing features for our amazing client."
